(7070779, 1075732, 27421, '<td valign="top">I like the bird shadow....</td>', 'I like the bird shadow....', '2013-07-15 15:29:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7070843, 1075481, 96751, '<td valign="top">The focus being on the ear rather than on the face, I feel detracts from this image.</td>', 'The focus being on the ear rather than on the face, I feel detracts from this image.', '2013-07-15 17:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7070844, 1075599, 96751, '<td valign="top">I, too, stop and admire this sort of lighting. But I''d have cropped out everything but the window.</td>', 'I, too, stop and admire this sort of lighting. But I''d have cropped out everything but the window.', '2013-07-15 17:10:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7070845, 1075689, 96751, '<td valign="top">Love how the light kissed her cheek</td>', 'Love how the light kissed her cheek', '2013-07-15 17:10:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7070846, 1075739, 96751, '<td valign="top">I appreciate the intention of this image. For me, it lacks in dynamics. There is a shape, but it has no real dimension, and is practically a silhouette. As such, it is not very interesting. I would have liked to see some sort of light and shadow play on the body, to illustrate the curves.</td>', 'I appreciate the intention of this image. For me, it lacks in dynamics. There is a shape, but it has no real dimension, and is practically a silhouette. As such, it is not very interesting. I would have liked to see some sort of light and shadow play on the body, to illustrate the curves.', '2013-07-15 17:12:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7070847, 1075208, 96751, '<td valign="top">The absence of any detail in the shadow makes this less interesting to me than it could be</td>', 'The absence of any detail in the shadow makes this less interesting to me than it could be', '2013-07-15 17:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7070849, 1075732, 96751, '<td valign="top">Lovely!!! That tiny shadow is immensely rewarding</td>', 'Lovely!!! That tiny shadow is immensely rewarding', '2013-07-15 17:13:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7070850, 1075734, 96751, '<td valign="top">A fascinating image, circles within circles. But to my mind, not a good example of light/shadow</td>', 'A fascinating image, circles within circles. But to my mind, not a good example of light/shadow', '2013-07-15 17:14:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7070851, 1075649, 96751, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done. I wonder how many people are going to miss the "magic".</td>', 'Very nicely done. I wonder how many people are going to miss the "magic".', '2013-07-15 17:15:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7070854, 1075742, 96751, '<td valign="top">This made me laugh. Awesome concept.</td>', 'This made me laugh. Awesome concept.', '2013-07-15 17:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7070855, 1075735, 96751, '<td valign="top">Exquisite. Floating in two dimensions. My favorite so far</td>', 'Exquisite. Floating in two dimensions. My favorite so far', '2013-07-15 17:17:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7070859, 1075730, 96751, '<td valign="top">Majestic! But not an example of light/shadow to me.</td>', 'Majestic! But not an example of light/shadow to me.', '2013-07-15 17:20:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7070860, 1075719, 96751, '<td valign="top">I like her mood, Wendy. And the details in the crinoline!!</td>', 'I like her mood, Wendy. And the details in the crinoline!!', '2013-07-15 17:20:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7070861, 1075220, 96751, '<td valign="top">Love those birds!</td>', 'Love those birds!', '2013-07-15 17:21:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7070862, 1074871, 96751, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, Weston-esque</td>', 'Beautiful, Weston-esque', '2013-07-15 17:21:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7070863, 1075152, 96751, '<td valign="top">Very interesting, although I find the texture more interesting than the image itself. I"m guessing this is a macro of something.</td>', 'Very interesting, although I find the texture more interesting than the image itself. I"m guessing this is a macro of something.', '2013-07-15 17:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7070865, 1075708, 96751, '<td valign="top">This is one of the few images I feel capture the spirit of the challenge, conveying a cause/effect relationship between shadow and light. In this case, the shadows help create a story. From a technical standpoint, it appears you''ve used a flashlight, which created a hot spot on the edge of the books. I might have tried to fix that a bit in editing. On the other hand, it sort of adds to the "ghost hunters" quality of this image</td>', 'This is one of the few images I feel capture the spirit of the challenge, conveying a cause/effect relationship between shadow and light. In this case, the shadows help create a story. From a technical standpoint, it appears you''ve used a flashlight, which created a hot spot on the edge of the books. I might have tried to fix that a bit in editing. On the other hand, it sort of adds to the "ghost hunters" quality of this image', '2013-07-15 17:24:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7070870, 1075705, 96751, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. I especially love the shadow of her lashes. In fact, I might have cropped this to just her face</td>', 'Beautiful. I especially love the shadow of her lashes. In fact, I might have cropped this to just her face', '2013-07-15 17:25:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7070872, 1075610, 96751, '<td valign="top">LOVE everything about this. My top choice so far. I love the tones, the patterns, the dirt smudge dead center, and especially that she looks like she''s floating over a wall.</td>', 'LOVE everything about this. My top choice so far. I love the tones, the patterns, the dirt smudge dead center, and especially that she looks like she''s floating over a wall.', '2013-07-15 17:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7070875, 1075743, 96751, '<td valign="top">Bold geometry. Very yin/yang. Two realities torn apart by opposing forces</td>', 'Bold geometry. Very yin/yang. Two realities torn apart by opposing forces', '2013-07-15 17:27:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7070876, 1075529, 96751, '<td valign="top">Very elegant tones. Just a bit more detail on the dark side of the peach, please</td>', 'Very elegant tones. Just a bit more detail on the dark side of the peach, please', '2013-07-15 17:27:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7070877, 1075435, 96751, '<td valign="top">I love this type of photography. Looks to be IR?</td>', 'I love this type of photography. Looks to be IR?', '2013-07-15 17:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7070878, 1075438, 96751, '<td valign="top">Fog? Check. Sun beams? Check. Shadows? Check. Beautiful setting? Check. Lovely image. The wall in the middle mars the natural tranquility a bit :-(</td>', 'Fog? Check. Sun beams? Check. Shadows? Check. Beautiful setting? Check. Lovely image. The wall in the middle mars the natural tranquility a bit :-(', '2013-07-15 17:29:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7070880, 1075738, 96751, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous kitty.</td>', 'Gorgeous kitty.', '2013-07-15 17:30:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7070881, 1075699, 96751, '<td valign="top">Makes my eyes do funny things</td>', 'Makes my eyes do funny things', '2013-07-15 17:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7070883, 1075571, 96751, '<td valign="top">Marvelous. A male version of my image, LOL!!!  LOVE the zig zag shape caused by the shadow, with an exclamation point down left :-)</td>', 'Marvelous. A male version of my image, LOL!!!  LOVE the zig zag shape caused by the shadow, with an exclamation point down left :-)', '2013-07-15 17:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7070885, 1075702, 96751, '<td valign="top">That''s quite a dress!!! Nice shadows, park setting... I''m going to hazard a guess that this is Juliet''s fine work, and if it isn''t, you''ve just been highly complimented</td>', 'That''s quite a dress!!! Nice shadows, park setting... I''m going to hazard a guess that this is Juliet''s fine work, and if it isn''t, you''ve just been highly complimented', '2013-07-15 17:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7070886, 1075485, 96751, '<td valign="top">Minimalist. Perfect placement of the leaf. Tell me you didn''t move it there :-)</td>', 'Minimalist. Perfect placement of the leaf. Tell me you didn''t move it there :-)', '2013-07-15 17:33:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7070887, 1075704, 96751, '<td valign="top">Did they come out of that trunk? Are they going back into it? An almost surreal image - I wish the shadows were doing something completely different from the actual people :-)</td>', 'Did they come out of that trunk? Are they going back into it? An almost surreal image - I wish the shadows were doing something completely different from the actual people :-)', '2013-07-15 17:33:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7070888, 1075669, 96751, '<td valign="top">Nice, horror film quality</td>', 'Nice, horror film quality', '2013-07-15 17:34:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7070889, 1075604, 96751, '<td valign="top">I think this might have been even better with a square crop</td>', 'I think this might have been even better with a square crop', '2013-07-15 17:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7070890, 1075636, 96751, '<td valign="top">Clever!</td>', 'Clever!', '2013-07-15 17:35:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7070892, 1075731, 96751, '<td valign="top">Lovely tones, and the shadow is breathtaking. I''d like this cropped square, with most of the actual glass cut out. Leave more of a mystery</td>', 'Lovely tones, and the shadow is breathtaking. I''d like this cropped square, with most of the actual glass cut out. Leave more of a mystery', '2013-07-15 17:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7070893, 1075467, 96751, '<td valign="top">Very noire. The air seems thick with impending something</td>', 'Very noire. The air seems thick with impending something', '2013-07-15 17:36:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7070896, 1075717, 96751, '<td valign="top">I can''t figure out why I don''t love this image. it''s a good pov, nice tones, etc. And yet...<br/> <br/>on the other hand, I''m captivated by the cyclist''s shadow on the right, and when I crop out everything from the edge of the leg to the left, I''m left with a very intriguing image</td>', 'I can''t figure out why I don''t love this image. it''s a good pov, nice tones, etc. And yet... on the other hand, I''m captivated by the cyclist''s shadow on the right, and when I crop out everything from the edge of the leg to the left, I''m left with a very intriguing image', '2013-07-15 17:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7070897, 1075661, 96751, '<td valign="top">I guess I''m all about square crops today. I think this image would have been stronger if it had been square</td>', 'I guess I''m all about square crops today. I think this image would have been stronger if it had been square', '2013-07-15 17:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7070898, 1075667, 96751, '<td valign="top">I''d hang this in my kitchen. The border is overkill, but the image is quite lovely</td>', 'I''d hang this in my kitchen. The border is overkill, but the image is quite lovely', '2013-07-15 17:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7070899, 1075721, 96751, '<td valign="top">Long shadows are my favorite. Great texture on the road</td>', 'Long shadows are my favorite. Great texture on the road', '2013-07-15 17:40:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7070900, 1075416, 96751, '<td valign="top">I like it!</td>', 'I like it!', '2013-07-15 17:41:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7071012, 1075607, 10785, '<td valign="top">I like the golden hour light here. However I think the shadow isn''t quite deep enough. It has been brightened in these areas by the HDR.</td>', 'I like the golden hour light here. However I think the shadow isn''t quite deep enough. It has been brightened in these areas by the HDR.', '2013-07-15 20:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7071013, 1075738, 10785, '<td valign="top">You captured the very bright light rather nicely, however there isn''t much shadow unless you count the background brought into shadow through underexposure.</td>', 'You captured the very bright light rather nicely, however there isn''t much shadow unless you count the background brought into shadow through underexposure.', '2013-07-15 20:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
