(7073262, 1075621, 97225, '<td valign="top">Beautiful architecture, lovely composition and tones, lovely fall of light/shadow.</td>', 'Beautiful architecture, lovely composition and tones, lovely fall of light/shadow.', '2013-07-18 03:43:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7073569, 1075669, 134859, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love this photograph!  Such an eerie photo.  So dark, yet there''s the light.  <br/>The blur of the hand gives a sense of motion, that the subject is trying to escape some deep, dark hell.  <br/>This picture evokes so many different emotions, so many different scenarios.  It''s wonderfully done and is my favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'I absolutely love this photograph!  Such an eerie photo.  So dark, yet there''s the light.  The blur of the hand gives a sense of motion, that the subject is trying to escape some deep, dark hell.  This picture evokes so many different emotions, so many different scenarios.  It''s wonderfully done and is my favorite of the challenge.', '2013-07-18 21:56:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7073580, 1075220, 134859, '<td valign="top">Wonderful photo!  Love the amber shade.  Very warm, glowing.  But still is able to work with your title.  Had the color been any other, I don''t think the title would have been so fitting.  The use of light and dark is wonderful.  The bits and pieces of the person you can see is just enough to tell a story.  Great job!  Second favorite photo in the challenge.</td>', 'Wonderful photo!  Love the amber shade.  Very warm, glowing.  But still is able to work with your title.  Had the color been any other, I don''t think the title would have been so fitting.  The use of light and dark is wonderful.  The bits and pieces of the person you can see is just enough to tell a story.  Great job!  Second favorite photo in the challenge.', '2013-07-18 22:11:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7073765, 1075649, 151598, '<td valign="top">Confused by the text in the shadow being legible and not inverted?  Unless the logo text was actually printed inverted to begin with?</td>', 'Confused by the text in the shadow being legible and not inverted?  Unless the logo text was actually printed inverted to begin with?', '2013-07-19 01:45:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7074275, 1075748, 65234, '<td valign="top">That is a great shot of one!  I love that I can see a catchlight in the eye and that you got so much detail in the wings.   Love those bugs :-)</td>', 'That is a great shot of one!  I love that I can see a catchlight in the eye and that you got so much detail in the wings.   Love those bugs :-)', '2013-07-19 22:16:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7074277, 1075529, 65234, '<td valign="top">Dutch Master sort of lighting. Which I happen to love.</td>', 'Dutch Master sort of lighting. Which I happen to love.', '2013-07-19 22:17:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7074281, 1075707, 65234, '<td valign="top">It looks like it''s exploding. Possibly a cloud of spores, or an optical illusion ;-). But it reminds me of a magician''s cauldron, which is rather entertaining.</td>', 'It looks like it''s exploding. Possibly a cloud of spores, or an optical illusion ;-). But it reminds me of a magician''s cauldron, which is rather entertaining.', '2013-07-19 22:19:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7074287, 1075705, 65234, '<td valign="top">I like the dramatic lighting, but I find myself wishing the model had an outfit that suited the mood of the lighting better.</td>', 'I like the dramatic lighting, but I find myself wishing the model had an outfit that suited the mood of the lighting better.', '2013-07-19 22:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7074289, 1075719, 65234, '<td valign="top">Sad ballerina :-(. Nicely lit.</td>', 'Sad ballerina :-(. Nicely lit.', '2013-07-19 22:27:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7074291, 1075697, 65234, '<td valign="top">Not a huge fan of statue pictures, and in this case the background is overwhelming my eye.  B&amp;W might work better, and a softening of the background.  IMO.</td>', 'Not a huge fan of statue pictures, and in this case the background is overwhelming my eye.  B&W might work better, and a softening of the background.  IMO.', '2013-07-19 22:29:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7074292, 1075708, 65234, '<td valign="top">The shadows would be so much more intriguing to me if I couldn''t see that statue at all.  It''s still interesting, mind you.</td>', 'The shadows would be so much more intriguing to me if I couldn''t see that statue at all.  It''s still interesting, mind you.', '2013-07-19 22:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7074294, 1075669, 65234, '<td valign="top">This one''s got my imagination going.  Nicely done!</td>', 'This one''s got my imagination going.  Nicely done!', '2013-07-19 22:34:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7074501, 1075747, 134859, '<td valign="top">I really like this photograph.  The grunge appearance.  Dirty.  Scary.  But beautiful in its own way.  <br/>Love how the light highlights the large white object (pillow?) and the doll head.  Eerie feeling here.</td>', 'I really like this photograph.  The grunge appearance.  Dirty.  Scary.  But beautiful in its own way.  Love how the light highlights the large white object (pillow?) and the doll head.  Eerie feeling here.', '2013-07-20 11:32:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7074502, 1075648, 134859, '<td valign="top">I have always wanted to shoot a covered bridge.  That''s actually on my photography bucket list.  lol<br/>Love the vintage/sepia color here.  It gives a better effect than a color photo would have (so I assume, at least).</td>', 'I have always wanted to shoot a covered bridge.  That''s actually on my photography bucket list.  lolLove the vintage/sepia color here.  It gives a better effect than a color photo would have (so I assume, at least).', '2013-07-20 11:33:20.000000', NULL, 1),
