(7074974, 1075702, 63218, '<td valign="top">WOW! this is a truly spectacular haute couture dress! very difficult to do it justice with a mere photograph but I think you did exactly that. Congratulations! 10</td>', 'WOW! this is a truly spectacular haute couture dress! very difficult to do it justice with a mere photograph but I think you did exactly that. Congratulations! 10', '2013-07-21 17:00:02.000000', NULL, 1),
