(7075391, 1075702, 99263, '<td valign="top">Congratz onthe 4th place. It''s a really lovely and unusual image in it''s own right but to me it does not meet the challenge requirement that light and shadow vie with each other for attention. At least not the way I envisioned it.</td>', 'Congratz onthe 4th place. It''s a really lovely and unusual image in it''s own right but to me it does not meet the challenge requirement that light and shadow vie with each other for attention. At least not the way I envisioned it.', '2013-07-22 04:58:13.000000', NULL, 0),
