(7075452, 1075610, 103142, '<td valign="top">I completely disagree with Fred -- I love how the light plays on the background and the shadow interrupts it all. This is an awesome shot, thoroughly enjoyable. 9 from me and is going in my favorites. Beautifully done!</td>', 'I completely disagree with Fred -- I love how the light plays on the background and the shadow interrupts it all. This is an awesome shot, thoroughly enjoyable. 9 from me and is going in my favorites. Beautifully done!', '2013-07-22 10:05:35.000000', NULL, 0),
