(7075568, 1075747, 162801, '<td valign="top">Thanks so much for the votes and comments everyone!  I really appreciate it!<br/> <br/>I thought that the photo itself covered the description of the challenge well, but the selection and processing was done with less than 10min before the challenge ended...so...maybe a little too dark overall?<br/> <br/>this photo was taken on the west side of manhattan on west side highway and clarkson st.  its an alleyway of a tiny tiny abandoned 1950''s diner that was once called the ''lost diner''.<br/> <br/>thanks again everyone for the fantastic comments and votes!!!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Thanks so much for the votes and comments everyone!  I really appreciate it! I thought that the photo itself covered the description of the challenge well, but the selection and processing was done with less than 10min before the challenge ended...so...maybe a little too dark overall? this photo was taken on the west side of manhattan on west side highway and clarkson st.  its an alleyway of a tiny tiny abandoned 1950''s diner that was once called the ''lost diner''. thanks again everyone for the fantastic comments and votes!!! ', '2013-07-22 13:34:30.000000', NULL, 0),
